                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Is founder-led growth realistic for all D2C founders?</h3>
                                        <p>Only for founders willing to commit 5-15 hours / week + authentic public presence + long-term consistency. Not all founders temperamentally suited.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest founder-led growth ROI?</h3>
                                        <p>Compound brand equity + free media coverage + investor + talent + partner attraction. Zero incremental cost.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I use ghost-writers?</h3>
                                        <p>For scale + volume: yes for content assistance. For voice + authenticity: no — audience detects inauthentic ghost-writing quickly.</p>
